<title>POLAND: Polish KGHM sees up to 30 pct of net for devidend.</title>
<headline>Polish KGHM sees up to 30 pct of net for devidend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The management of Polish copper concern KGHM Polska Miedz SA will propose earmarking up to 30 percent of the firm's net profits for dividend, beginning from 1997, the company said in its issue prospectus on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Last year KGHM's net profit amounted to 147.2 million zlotys. The company expects to earn 286 million zlotys in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
